notes.content:
[list]
[*] A new age has been introduced: the Second Industrial Revolution;
[*] Chat messages can be addressed either to everyone or to your allies;
[*] You can increase the size of user interfaces;
[*] New upgrades:
Smoothbore - opens the ability to use light firearms, wheel lock - increases the speed of the musket shot, improved harness - increases the speed of moving elephants, sorting supplies - increases the efficiency of storing a cargo elephant by 10%, granular gunpowder - increases damage from a bullet, drawings of a light tank - opens up the possibility of building a light tank, drawings of an armored car - opens up the possibility of building an armored car, mortar - makes it possible to train trench mortar, ballistic sight - increases the accuracy of cannons;
[*] On the maps, the amount of forest has been reduced;
[*] An overview of its territory is now open to the allies;
[*] In private matches, you can set a double limit on the population;
[*] Population limit limit increased from 50-75-125-200 to 60-90-150-250;
[*] The cost of moving to the Late Middle Ages increased by 1000 food and 500 materials;
[*] The cost of each Stone Age upgrade for damage and armor is reduced by 50 food;
[*] The volume of materials in the stone deposit is reduced from 20,000 to 10,000;
[*] The speed of creating a springald, rocket gun, ballista is reduced by 2 times;
[*] The construction time of towers is doubled;
[*] Howitzer: damage increased from 150 to 250, reload time increased from 10 to 12 seconds;
[*] Trench mortar: movement speed reduced, damage reduced from 80 to 70, projectile expansion increased from 20% to 25%;
[*] Light tank: health reduced from 650 to 600, view range reduced by 15%;
[*] Fight pit: construction cost reduced from 200 to 150 materials;
[*] Stonecutter: construction cost reduced from 150 to 130 materials;
[*] Bulwark: construction cost reduced from 50 to 40 food;
[*] Maceman: attack speed increased from 2.2 to 2 seconds;
[*] Slinger: damage increased from 6 to 7;
[*] Longbow: training cost reduced from 200 to 125 food;
[*] Fighting boat: attack speed increased from 2 to 1.5 seconds, arrow expansion decreased from 20% to 18%;
[*] Sampan: attack speed increased from 2.2 to 1.7 seconds, arrow expansion decreased from 20% to 18%;
[*] Elephant-Bashibuzuk: reload time of bashbuzuks increased from 2 to 4 seconds, projectile expansion reduced from 25% to 20%;
[*] Bashibuzuk:  reservation time  reduced from 50 to 40 seconds, shot damage increased from 12 to 15;
[*] Arquebuser:  reservation time reduced from 40 to 35 seconds, shot damage increased from 14 to 17;
[*] Dragoon (East Asia): reservation time reduced from 100 to 80 seconds, damage increased from 15 to 19;
[*] Dragoon (Eastern Europe): training time reduced from 80 to 65 seconds, damage increased from 15 to 19;
[*] Dragoon (Western Europe): training time reduced from 70 to 55 seconds, damage increased from 15 to 19;
[*] Strelets: training time reduced from 30 to 25 seconds, shot damage increased from 20 to 24;
[*] Musketeer: training time reduced from 35/25 to 30/20 sec, shot damage increased from 15 to 19;
[*] The alligator leaves a small meat after his death.
[/list]

[list]
[*] In private matches victory by holding a Wonder of the World can be switched off
[*] Player loses main building if exits a match;
[*] Information about victory or defeat of players is displayed in chat;
[*] Reservation of the first unit in the training building is visualized;
[*] Amount of metal and stone deposits on map is redused;
[*] Light tanks movement speed, armor and view range are slightly reduced
[*] Machine-gun tower attack frequency is now 4 sec (3 sec before);
[*] View range of many siege units is increased;
[*] Cost of transition to the Age of Industrial Revolution is increased;
[*] Cost of Wonder of the World is increased;
[*] A lot of bugs that caused game crashes are now fixed.
[/list]

We want to express our [b]gratitude[/b] to all of you.
Our gaming community has shown itself to be a friendly and positive team. We constantly receive from you a high-quality and detailed feedback on all difficulties in the game. 
Thanks to you we have made some adjustments

[list][*] Stronghold's durability increased. 150 instead of 100;
[*] Transition to the Industrial Revolution requires more resources;
[*] Wonders of the World require more resources for construction;
[*] Holding Wonder of the World for a victory takes 20 minutes (10 before);
[*] Wonder of the World can be destroyed by weak damage, but it will take considerable amount of time;
[*] Machine-gun tower attack frequency changed from 2 to 3 seconds, spread is increased from 5% to 8%;
[*] Asian fishing boat can be upgraded to Fishing schooner of Western Asia;
[*] Construction plans lifetime increased from 5 to 10 minutes;
[*] Amount of metal deposits is reduced;
[*] Amount of deposits of large fish is increased;
[*] Forge of Eastern and Western Europe can be upgraded into Arsenal after entering Industrial Revolution;
[*] A lot of errors have been fixed;[/list]
